implementationPlan.description:
VERIFY ONCE, fresh.

1. Run the DoD command, `node --test scripts/tests/local-runner-bridge.test.mjs scripts/tests/local-runner-agents.test.mjs`. On WSL, run it as `env -i HOME="$HOME" PATH="<nvm node 24 bin>:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin" node --test ...`, with POSIX python3 on PATH. It must exit 0; supply its command, exit code and output tail to complete_task.
2. ALSO run `node --test scripts/tests/local-runner.test.mjs` and report it; it holds the R11f and R10d3 supervisor rows.
3. Mutants, on scratch copies only; restore and cmp afterwards:
   (i) drop --strict-mcp-config: LA1;
   (ii) write the config before session_home, or into WORKSPACE: LA2;
   (iii) create without O_EXCL or O_NOFOLLOW: replace a pre-planted symlink at the config path in an LA2 variant (planted before prepare_launch through a session_home seam). It must give 71, with no file written through the link;
   (iv) pass the role from the frame into argv unvalidated: LA1's prompt pins;
   (v) change JOBS to 3-tuples: B17.
